    <h1>📊 Work Tracker Manual</h1>
    
    <p>Welcome to your professional <strong>Work Tracker & Salary Analytics System</strong>. This tool is designed to provide a seamless experience for tracking attendance, managing payroll, and generating professional reports without the need for complex spreadsheets.</p>

    <h2>✨ Key Features</h2>
    
    <h3>1. Smart Attendance Calendar</h3>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>One-Click Management:</strong> Simply click on any date to cycle through statuses: <span class="highlight">Present → Absent → WFH → Sunday → Holiday</span>.</li>
        <li><strong>Automatic Layout:</strong> The calendar features a "Compact Mode" specifically for longer months (May and August) to ensure the entire dashboard fits on a single screen without scrolling.</li>
        <li><strong>Visual Cues:</strong> Each status is color-coded for instant recognition (Green for Present, Blue for WFH, Red for Absent, etc.).</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>2. Payroll & Tax Logic</h3>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Real-time Salary:</strong> Calculates your earnings instantly as you update your attendance.</li>
        <li><strong>Tax Compliance:</strong> Includes a built-in logic to deduct <strong>₹110 Professional Tax (PTAX)</strong> automatically if your gross earnings exceed ₹10,000 for the month.</li>
        <li><strong>Efficiency Tracking:</strong> Calculates your "Net Earning per Work Day" to show you how much you are effectively earning for every day spent at the office or WFH.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>3. Data Visualization</h3>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Analytics Dashboard:</strong> Features high-quality bar charts powered by <em>Chart.js</em> to show your monthly work distribution.</li>
        <li><strong>Professional PDF:</strong> A dedicated print mode allows you to download your report. The sidebar and settings are automatically hidden to provide a clean "Salary Slip" style document.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>🚀 How to Use</h2>
    
    <ol>
        <li><strong>Profile Setup:</strong> Open the sidebar (☰), upload your picture, and enter your basic details like Name, Designation, and Base Salary. These details are used to generate your report headers.</li>
        <li><strong>Logging Work:</strong> At the end of each day, click the corresponding date on the calendar until the correct status appears.</li>
        <li><strong>Switching Months:</strong> Use the dropdown menus at the top of the calendar to navigate between different months and years. Your data is saved specifically for each month.</li>
        <li><strong>Safety (Backups):</strong> Since all data is stored in your browser's <span class="highlight">Local Storage</span>, use the <strong>"Export Backup"</strong> button monthly to save a file to your computer.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2>📐 Calculation Formulas</h2>
    <div class="formula-box">
        • Daily Rate = Base Salary / Total Days in Month<br>
        • Paid Days = (Present + WFH + Sunday + Holiday)<br>
        • Gross = Paid Days × Daily Rate<br>
        • Net Payout = Gross - (PTAX if Gross > 10,000)<br>
        • Loss of Pay = Absent Days × Daily Rate
    </div>

    <h2>🛡️ Privacy Note</h2>
    <p>This application is <strong>100% Client-Side</strong>. This means no data is ever sent to a server. Your personal information, salary data, and attendance records remain strictly on your own device.</p>

